From 051bdda602796c47c107419ae5afff8272d5ca2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emu Synths <emusynths@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:02:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Recompiler: enable scalar reload CSE for direct DXIL
 vertex and pixel shaders

Enable reload::analyze for Entry::Vertex and Entry::Pixel in the direct DXIL translator. Unlike two-phase Entry::Geometry, vertex and pixel shaders use the same single-entry Cfg::build as compute, so repeated s_load_dword* descriptor reloads can safely reuse their first values and avoid redundant memory-window switches.

Part of #2088

Assisted-by: Antigravity (Gemini 4 Neon)
Assisted-by: Codex (gpt-6.2-astra)
(cherry picked from commit 3a71471c80b842d8e6f2bffd74556947fc11921b)
